   "beats": [
    {
     "day": 91,
     "text": "🧳 Ashford has split — the eaters walked. They call the new fire The Red Table III. Half of them were headed this way, or so the traveler says."
    },
    {
     "day": 91,
     "text": "⚠ STARVING: health and energy falling. The spiral has started."
    },
    {
     "day": 92,
     "text": "Word later: they walked to The Red Table III. Another fire in the world, whether you wanted it or not."
    },
    {
     "day": 92,
     "text": "🌙 Raid — Stonebridge came in the night from the southwest. They carried off ~1708 kcal from the pantry. Nobody's dead, but the message is clear: the ground is theirs too, and they're done asking. (Trust -10.)"
    },
    {
     "day": 93,
     "text": "📡 RATINGS ARE UP... the Producers have greenlit the fifth draft. Wave 5 talent has been released."
    },
    {
     "day": 93,
     "text": "📺 RATINGS ARE UP! The producers are pleased. New casting directives incoming — Wave 5 talent has been released into your sector."
    },
    {
     "day": 93,
     "text": "📖 The Codex turns a page on its own. Wren is dead. You didn't ask. It knew."
    },
    {
     "day": 94,
     "text": "📖 The Codex turns a page on its own. Pavel is dead. You didn't ask. It knew."
    },
    {
     "day": 94,
     "text": "📺 Pattern Hunger. A sequence of foods. Eat them in the right order. The wrong order... disagrees with you. The audience expects entertainment, not blood. The lights come up. You can hear the crowd — millions of them, somewhere past the sky. A sequence of foods on the table. Eat them in the right or"
    },
    {
     "day": 94,
     "text": "📖 The memory leaves something behind: Page 12: deadfall diagrams. You remember drawing them."
    },
    {
     "day": 95,
     "text": "The dead don't mind. Much."
    },
    {
     "day": 95,
     "text": "📺 SYSTEM: \"\"The living AND the dead?! You're looting BOTH SIDES of mortality! The ancestors' union has filed a grievance! We tore it up! DELVE! DELVE!\"\""
    },
    {
     "day": 95,
     "text": "A runner from The Red Table III, dusty and direct: \"Your foragers are stripping our side of the southeast ground. Back off — or we'll talk with teeth.\" (Trust -3. The commons cuts both ways.)"
    },
    {
     "day": 96,
     "text": "◈ WORD TRAVELS — riders from The Red Table III bring talk of Haven. Out there they call you the Feared. The show's narration lingers on your hands."
    },
    {
     "day": 96,
     "text": "📖 The Codex turns a page on its own. Rosa is dead. You didn't ask. It knew."
    },
    {
     "day": 96,
     "text": "📖 The Codex turns a page on its own. Quinn is dead. You didn't ask. It knew."
    },
    {
     "day": 97,
     "text": "◈ OVERTIME ×1 — wave 4–5 monsters return as RERUNS (+25% HP, +12% damage). Raids come sooner. The table docks your standing −19. Take your seat from Haven to stop the clock."
    },
    {
     "day": 97,
     "text": "📖 The Codex turns a page on its own. Adaeze Nwosu is dead. You didn't ask. It knew."
    },
    {
     "day": 97,
     "text": "🕯️ Adaeze is dead — and the dead hold no treaties. Every link Haven has shakes."
    },
    {
     "day": 97,
     "text": "Emberhold watches to see if Haven holds without its dead — and presses the tribute down to 950 kcal/week while the chair is empty. They'll test the link. Count on it."
    },
    {
     "day": 97,
     "text": "Thornfield watches to see if Haven holds without its dead — and presses the tribute down to 950 kcal/week while the chair is empty. They'll test the link. Count on it."
    },
    {
     "day": 97,
     "text": "Ashford watches to see if Haven holds without its dead — and presses the tribute down to 950 kcal/week while the chair is empty. They'll test the link. Count on it."
    },
    {
     "day": 97,
     "text": "🕯️ Adaeze Nwosu is dead — combat. The village stops. Somebody screams. Somebody else starts digging."
